        [
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "It knows it wasted its time, and yet, it played well. It did not give up."
          }
        ],
        [{ "lang": "en", "text": "For this very reason, I like this player." }],
        [{ "lang": "en", "text": "I like how this player is so determined." }],
        [{ "lang": "en", "text": "I like how this player is so dedicated to its craft." }],
        [
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "I like how this player never stops until it finishes what it started."
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "And I'll miss how this player is now, later when they grow tall,"
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "text": "when obscurities such as money, finance, school, jobs, families, and the heat death of the universe consume someone I once knew."
